", "isRightAlt": false, "notRequired": false}, {"id": 4, "image": {"label": "", "imageURL": ""}, "action": {"name": "moveToStep", "doAction": false, "internalId": 0, "clickAction": false, "checkQuestion": false, "trackRepeatAnswer": false}, "isRight": false, "answerText": "Ивабрадин при синусовом ритме и ЧСС>80 при противопоказаниях к ББ.", "isRightAlt": false, "notRequired": false}, {"id": 5, "image": {"label": "", "imageURL": ""}, "action": {"name": "moveToStep", "doAction": false, "internalId": 0, "clickAction": false, "checkQuestion": false, "trackRepeatAnswer": false}, "isRight": false, "answerText": "Длительные нитраты (изосорбид мононитрат) как вторая линия.", "isRightAlt": false, "notRequired": false}, {"id": 6, "image": {"label": "", "imageURL": ""}, "action": {"name": "moveToStep", "doAction": false, "internalId": 0, "clickAction": false, "checkQuestion": false, "trackRepeatAnswer": false}, "isRight": false, "answerText": "Ранолазин/триметазидин/никорандил при недостаточном контроле.", "isRightAlt": false, "notRequired": false}, {"id": 7, "image": {"label": "", "imageURL": ""}, "action": {"name": "moveToStep", "doAction": false, "internalId": 0, "clickAction": false, "checkQuestion": false, "trackRepeatAnswer": false}, "isRight": false, "answerText": "Комбинация ББ с верапамилом/дилтиаземом.", "isRightAlt": false, "notRequired": false}, {"id": 8, "image": {"label": "", "imageURL": ""}, "action": {"name": "moveToStep", "doAction": false, "internalId": 0, "clickAction": false, "checkQuestion": false, "trackRepeatAnswer": false}, "isRight": false, "answerText": "АСК 75–100 мг/сут.", "isRightAlt": false, "notRequired": false}, {"id": 9, "image": {"label": "", "imageURL": ""}, "action": {"name": "moveToStep", "doAction": false, "internalId": 0, "clickAction": false, "checkQuestion": false, "trackRepeatAnswer": false}, "isRight": false, "answerText": "Высокоинтенсивный статин с целью ЛНП <1.4 ммоль/л.", "isRightAlt": false, "notRequired": false}, {"id": 10, "ima